# Origin of the SLAYERS FastAPI backend.
#
# The trailing /api is optional — the client normalises either form.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_* values are inlined at BUILD time, so on Vercel this must be set
# in Project Settings → Environment Variables and the project redeployed after
# any change. Setting it only in a local .env will not affect a deployed build.
#
# Local development:
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8000

# Production example:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://slayers-api.onrender.com
